# Glyph metadata (MEGS-0004)

Catalog entries MUST include: `id`, `shortcode`, `category`, `meanings.{visual,semantic,engineering}`, `accessibility.{name,description}`, `ai.{intent,llmInstructions,recommendedPrompts,engineeringContext}`, `aliases`, `keywords`, `tags`.

- Validate against `docs/megs/schemas/glyph-metadata.schema.json` when writing JSON.
- `ai.llmInstructions` MUST be actionable and MUST NOT bypass human-approval / security glyphs.
- Style guide prose SHOULD stay aligned with the schema field names.
